  "content": "<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gNKaWWz.jpg\"></h5><h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\"></strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 全面翻新的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 數千個全新地城與建築（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wabi-sabi-structures-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabi-Sabi 建築</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">城鎮與高塔</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 打造你的專屬王國（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">StyleColonies</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 探索魔法次元（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a>與擴充包、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 全面優化，支援光影模組</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 翻新要塞與堡壘</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 強大頭目與神話生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 深度魔法模組（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵咒術與咒術書</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon-repraised\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon: Repraised</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫師重生</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 體力、口渴與溫度系統（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survive\" rel=\"nofollow\">Survive</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 簡單任務引導你前進</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 生活品質功能，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">可升級背包</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式中世紀 RPG 體驗</strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ 內建<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費世界共享</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64101%252fmedieval-mc-forge-mmc4\" rel=\"nofollow\">350+ 模組</a>，經過高度自訂以確保整合與相容性</strong></h5><h5><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://lunapixel.studio/discord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></a></strong></h5><p><strong><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rz_N4-2tevs\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dFd3YVpPFe0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></strong></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><strong>非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准，亦與其無關。</strong></strong></span></h5>",
